Z||000000||lennyb4||07-14-2000||11:12 AM||||Just got off the phone with a lady not to far from my house. She has a 1986 GT w/74,000 miles for sale. Mint condition inside and out, fully loaded, black ext. with some kind off side decal and grey interior. The car has not run for a couple of months. From what she discribed it sounds like it might be either the coil or module. Either way i dont care. The best part is she said bring $300.00 and its mine...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Yaaaaahhhhhooooooo.......<P>**Man i am sooooo siked up about this, havent been this worked up in along time. I feel like i just won the lottery or something. Sorry just sooo excited had to tell someone..<p>[This message has been edited by lennyb4 (edited 07-14-2000).]||||reg||1
